:false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98307","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98307","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98307.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98307.patch","merged_at":"2024-11-10T18:19:43Z"},"body":"Small optimization I found while profiling CPU performance. `light_update_shadow()` was calculating the same matrices every time it was called even though they never change. \r\n\r\nI also pulled the calculation of the projection matrix out of the loop (although I am 99% certain this was optimized out of the loop anyway in release builds).\r\n\r\nProfiled when running the [Isometric demo](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/2d/isometric)\r\n\r\n_Before: `light_update_shadow()` takes 17.1% of the CPU frame time_\r\n![Screenshot from 2024-10-16 18-09-40](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ea3de187-5a7a-4bec-addc-c96576c764ce)\r\n\r\n_After: `light_update_shadow()` takes 14.7% of the CPU frame time. Notice that the `from_euler` chunk is gone completely_\r\n![Screenshot from 2024-10-16 18-09-46](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e434fb56-ffa0-4371-bf1e-1377b8f604d9)\r\n\r\nThis demo is GPU-bound so this doesn't change the framerate. ","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url"